0034 | 
0035 |   // insert-with-dedup helpers (concrete Val key equality via ==K). [total] so buildFold over a dict is
0036 |   // total (its #Ceil is #Top) — needed when a symbolic proof carries a built dict as a config value.
END 0032 rule
BEGIN 0037 syntax attrs=function,total
